# counter

Count up and down by one.

```ts
import { decrement, increment } from "../src/counter.js";

expect(increment(1)).toBe(2);
expect(decrement(3)).toBe(2);
```

`test/counter.usage.test.ts` runs this example.

# parse

Read a true or false flag.

```ts
import { parseFlag } from "../src/parse.js";

expect(parseFlag("true")).toBe(true);
expect(parseFlag("maybe")).toBeNull();
```

`test/parse.usage.test.ts` runs this example.

